; M1911A1 pistol, assembled from primitives.
; Local space matches the other weapons: barrel fires along -Z, +Y up. Roughly
; life-size (~0.22m long), held out at arm's length rather than shouldered,
; which is what the long `eye_relief` is doing.
;
; The slide is the node named BoltHandle: the base magazine reload racks it
; back and forward at the end, which is exactly what loading a pistol looks
; like. The magazine lives inside the grip and drops out the bottom of it.
[gd_scene load_steps=26 format=3]

